---@field Accuracy? aws.iot_wireless.Accuracy The accuracy of the estimated position in meters. An empty value indicates that no position data is available. A value of ‘0.0’ value indicates that position data is available. This data corresponds to the position information that you specified instead of the position computed by solver.
---@field SolverType? aws.iot_wireless.PositionSolverType The type of solver used to identify the position of the resource.
---@field SolverProvider? aws.iot_wireless.PositionSolverProvider The vendor of the positioning solver.
---@field SolverVersion? aws.iot_wireless.PositionSolverVersion The version of the positioning solver.
---@field Timestamp? aws.iot_wireless.ISODateTimeString The timestamp at which the device's position was determined.

